{% comment %}
  ============================================================================
  task 0004 (Task 1) — About Page, Section 4: "Join Our Wellness Community" (closing CTA)
  ============================================================================
  Simple centered card: heading, paragraph, two buttons. Content from AboutPage.tsx in the
  Hydrogen reference. 0004_task1_intent.md flagged this one as simple enough it "might not even
  need custom code" — built as real custom code anyway per the kickoff instruction to produce
  actual .liquid files for all 4 sections, but it's a small, single-purpose file and would be
  an easy native-blocks substitute later if DXB prefers (a native rich-text/banner section +
  two native Button blocks covers the same ground).

  NO BLOCKS: single-instance content (one heading, one paragraph, two fixed buttons) — no
  repeatable list here, so this is plain section settings, same reasoning as
  bfbella-about-story.liquid above.

  BUTTON LINKS: both buttons use a native `url` setting (Shopify's link picker — pages,
  collections, products, or a plain external URL), not a hardcoded path, matching the pattern
  already used for the Growers-group link in blocks/bfbella-community-card.liquid (task 0003,
  Task 9). Production points these at `/shop` and `/contact` — map to the real Shopify
  shop/collection and contact page URLs once those exist; see 0004_task1_howto.md.

  CONTENT: zero real copy hardcoded — heading, paragraph, and both button labels are blank
  native settings until DXB fills them in.

  COLOR: no hardcoded hex. Accent (primary button) resolves through
  `section.settings.accent_color`, falling back to `color_palette.color3`. Background resolves
  through `section.settings.background_color`, falling back to `settings.color_palette.background`
  — light section, matching the page's other non-photo sections (Story+Mission, Values).

  DEPLOY: this file was written directly into this live repo's working tree as the first
  target of the 2026-09-07 live-edit pilot (see claude_docs/build_docs/live_edit_pilot_plan.md)
  — a deliberate exception to this project's normal task-folder-only rule, for this trial only.
  Claude still did not commit or push this — DXB reviews this diff, then commits and pushes by
  hand, unchanged from the standing rule.

  2026-09-07 UPDATE: DXB noted production's version of this section sits inside a bounded card
  with a dropshadow, not plain centered text directly on the section background. Gave
  `.bfbella-about-cta__card` its own background (the theme's own Background swatch via
  `var(--color-background)`, not a hardcoded color), padding, rounded corners, and a shadow —
  the same "card floating on the section" treatment already used by this project's other card
  components (value-card, benefit-card, guide-card, etc.), just applied to the CTA's whole
  content block instead of a grid of individual cards.

  2026-09-07 UPDATE 2: DXB wanted the inner card to have its OWN independent background color
  choice, separate from the section's — the section is one colorable surface, the bounded
  card sitting on top of it is a second, both pickable. DXB suggested a Group block for this;
  went with a second `card_background_color` section setting instead (same
  Liquid-`default:`-to-palette-swatch pattern as every other color in this file) rather than
  restructuring this single-instance section into a block-based one — same visual outcome
  (independently colorable section + card) without adding theme-blocks machinery to a section
  that has no repeatable content and doesn't otherwise need it. Also fixed the eyebrow badge on
  bfbella-about-story.liquid to match: larger padding and a subtle accent-colored border,
  matching AboutPage.tsx's actual eyebrow markup (`bg-accent/10 border border-accent/30 px-4
  py-2 rounded-full`) which this project's earlier build had approximated slightly off.
  ============================================================================
{% endcomment %}

{% liquid
  assign accent = section.settings.accent_color | default: settings.color_palette.color3
  assign bg = section.settings.background_color | default: settings.color_palette.background
  assign card_bg = section.settings.card_background_color | default: settings.color_palette.background

  if section.settings.background_color != blank
    render 'contrast-override', background_color: section.settings.background_color, section_id: section.id, skip_contrast: true
  endif
%}

<div
  id="AboutCta-{{ section.id }}"
  class="bfbella-about-cta{% if section.settings.background_color != blank %} color-custom-{{ section.id }}{% endif %}"
  style="
    --bfbella-accent: {{ accent }};
    --bfbella-bg: {{ bg }};
    --bfbella-card-bg: {{ card_bg }};
    {% if section.settings.padding_top != blank %}--bfbella-pad-top: {{ section.settings.padding_top }}px;{% endif %}
    {% if section.settings.padding_bottom != blank %}--bfbella-pad-bottom: {{ section.settings.padding_bottom }}px;{% endif %}
  "
>
  <div class="bfbella-about-cta__inner page-width">
    <div class="bfbella-about-cta__card">
      {%- if section.settings.heading != blank -%}
        <h2 class="bfbella-about-cta__heading">{{ section.settings.heading }}</h2>
      {%- endif -%}
      {%- if section.settings.paragraph != blank -%}
        <p class="bfbella-about-cta__paragraph">{{ section.settings.paragraph }}</p>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- if section.settings.button1_label != blank or section.settings.button2_label != blank -%}
        <div class="bfbella-about-cta__buttons">
          {%- if section.settings.button1_label != blank -%}
            <a
              {% if section.settings.button1_link != blank %}href="{{ section.settings.button1_link }}"{% else %}role="link" aria-disabled="true"{% endif %}
              class="bfbella-about-cta__button bfbella-about-cta__button--primary"
            >
              {{ section.settings.button1_label }}
            </a>
          {%- endif -%}
          {%- if section.settings.button2_label != blank -%}
            <a
              {% if section.settings.button2_link != blank %}href="{{ section.settings.button2_link }}"{% else %}role="link" aria-disabled="true"{% endif %}
              class="bfbella-about-cta__button bfbella-about-cta__button--secondary"
            >
              {{ section.settings.button2_label }}
            </a>
          {%- endif -%}
        </div>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

{% stylesheet %}
  .bfbella-about-cta {
    position: relative;
    padding-block-start: var(--bfbella-pad-top, 5rem);
    padding-block-end: var(--bfbella-pad-bottom, 5rem);
    background-color: var(--bfbella-bg);
    color: var(--color-foreground);
  }

  .bfbella-about-cta__inner {
    max-width: 80rem;
    margin-inline: auto;
    padding-inline: 1.5rem;
  }

  .bfbella-about-cta__card {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 44rem;
    margin-inline: auto;
    padding: 3rem 2.5rem;
    background-color: var(--bfbella-card-bg);
    border-radius: 1.5rem;
    box-shadow: 0 20px 25px -5px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.1), 0 8px 10px -6px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.1);
  }

  .bfbella-about-cta__heading {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4.5vw, 3rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin-block-end: 1.25rem;
  }

  .bfbella-about-cta__paragraph {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    opacity: 0.75;
    margin-block-end: 2rem;
  }

  .bfbella-about-cta__buttons {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .bfbella-about-cta__button {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 0.9rem 2rem;
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: transform 0.2s;
  }

  .bfbella-about-cta__button:hover {
    transform: scale(1.03);
  }

  .bfbella-about-cta__button--primary {
    background-color: var(--bfbella-accent);
    color: #fff;
  }

  .bfbella-about-cta__button--secondary {
    background-color: transparent;
    color: var(--color-foreground);
    border: 2px solid rgb(var(--color-foreground-rgb) / 0.2);
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .bfbella-about-cta__button {
      transition: none;
    }
  }
{% endstylesheet %}

